      "writtenOn": "2017-04-24T19:59:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just being paranoid. The queue is flushed when the OLT is activated. Anything in the queue prior to the OLT being activated is ignored. ONUs that are present on the PON but not yet provisioned will continue to advertise themselves during the ONU discovery window until they are provisioned.",
